      "message": "These are unit tests for the APM. They provide a dummy implementation of the APM Client, so you can validate the parameters of the operations that the APM calls on the AudioFlinger. Also, it is possible to create a custom APM configuration (although it might not be needed in this case). You can run these tests with `atest audiopolicy_tests`. You can check the existing tests, for example this one simulates connection of an USB device: https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:frameworks/av/services/audiopolicy/tests/audiopolicymanager_tests.cpp;l\u003d1063;drc\u003da0fe70939b7b3d5ca5dbba09b6f884017a61387c. The idea is that first you add a test for this functionality and it expected to be failing until you add this fix to APM.",
